# Everything CI's "Lint and test" job runs, before anything leaves the machine.
#
# The same script, not a copy of its steps: `pnpm verify` is what
# .github/workflows/ci.yml runs, so this cannot pass while CI fails for a
# reason that was checkable here. That is the specific hole it fills — the
# pre-commit hook runs lint-staged and the tests, and neither of those compiles
# a package against its own tsconfig.build.json, which is where the DOM-free
# packages are actually held to being DOM-free.
#
# It takes a couple of minutes. `git push --no-verify` skips it for a push that
# genuinely cannot wait; CI still has the last word either way.
pnpm verify
